 "title": "密度算符",
 "short": "密度算符",
 "lead": "<span data-concept=\"density-operator\">密度算符</span>，它描述仅通过各态的概率才为人所知的量子系统：<span data-concept=\"pure-and-mixed-states\">纯态与混合态</span>，每个密度算符都具有的性质，<span data-concept=\"expectation-value\">期望值</span>如何由它得出，带有<span data-concept=\"density-matrix-populations\">布居</span>和<span data-concept=\"density-matrix-coherences\">相干性</span>的<span data-concept=\"density-matrix\">密度矩阵</span>，以及热平衡中的两个系统，一个<span data-concept=\"two-level-atom\">二能级原子</span>和辐射场的一个模。",
